      "title": "Brooklyn building collapse kills at least two people and traps others in wreckage",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/11/deadly-brooklyn-building-collapse",
      "description": "<p>Four critical in hospital as firefighters dig through rubble in Flatbush after building next to construction site collapses</p><p>Firefighters dug through the rubble of a three-story building in <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/brooklyn\">Brooklyn</a> on Wednesday after it collapsed at the edge of a construction site, killing at least two people and trapping others beneath the wreckage.</p><p>Firefighters were called to the scene in the borough’s Flatbush section at about 4pm. News helicopter footage showed dozens of firefighters scouring the debris, with a group homing in on one area and appearing to use a saw to cut through the wreckage.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/nov/11/deadly-brooklyn-building-collapse\">Continue reading...</a>",
